@startuml
title Harness：Render Tool 按 SQL 创建或更新 UI
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Harness MainGraph" as Graph
database "HarnessState" as State
participant "Render Tool" as RenderTool
participant "A2aAgentExecutor" as Executor
participant "A2UI Client" as Client

Graph -> Graph : AssessPresentation = render
Graph -> State : AppendRenderCommand\n追加 render CommandRecord(pending)\ninput = {requirement, sql, data, meta_data}
Graph -> RenderTool : ExecuteCurrentCommand 的 tool_call\nRenderCommandInput + render_registry + latest_a2ui_surface

alt SQL 首次出现
  RenderTool -> RenderTool : 生成并校验新 UI 节点\n创建节点 + 填充 data model
  RenderTool -> RenderTool : 登记 sql -> surfaceId
else SQL 已绑定 surfaceId
  RenderTool -> RenderTool : 只更新该 UI 节点的 data model
end

RenderTool --> Graph : ToolMessage\n{render_registry, a2ui_surface, surface_id, published_operations}
Graph -> State : RegisterCommandResult\nrender -> succeeded\n回写 render_registry 与 latest_a2ui_surface
Graph --> Executor : 最新完整 A2UI surface
Executor --> Client : A2A artifact / surface update

note over RenderTool,State
一个 render CommandRecord 只对应一个 SQL 与一个 UI 目标。
Render Tool 决定创建或更新；Harness 不传递 surfaceId。
end note
@enduml
